# The item master and its change history (ticket #121, D59 (9), (10)). Both tables are tenant tables under the
# standard isolation policy, audited by trigger, and readable by job handlers (the MyInvois mapping reads the codes)
# but never writable by them. The rules that must hold whoever writes are kept in the database, like the guards of
# 0034 and 0035:
